ize":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-6"},{"id":"848e7363-e17a-41a9-becf-36f3089430b8","type":"text","text":"关键词：脉宽；脉冲；数显；电容（小四、宋体）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-7"}],[{"id":"e9842a1a-03c4-4260-a615-fae6dcac8274","type":"text","text":"**基于视觉巡线的自动行驶小车系统设计**","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-0"},{"type":"title","text":"# **一、系统方案**","text_level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"a467ef10-998d-47b1-aed2-c878bf8ecd3e","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-1"},{"id":"6d694c31-5f81-4768-832a-6fe631c6e7f9","type":"text","text":"本系统主要由单片机控制模块、XXX模块、XXX模块、电源模块组成，下面分别论证这几个模块的选择。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-2"},{"type":"title","text":"## **1、主控制器件的论证与选择**","text_level":2,"page_idx":1,"id":"d43a5b4e-6d9a-4d20-a099-29ec48bd93b7","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-3"},{"id":"9bfae967-ea3f-40d7-9226-f4588947d8ce","type":"text","text":"1\\.1\\.1控制器选用","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-4"},{"id":"4f0d88ea-6c19-40f3-b2e3-50fad20445cb","type":"text","text":"单片机比较","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-5"},{"id":"1b0d5afc-1328-4f5b-aa77-6c9a1ce450fc","type":"text","text":"方案一：采用传统的51系列单片机。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-6"},{"id":"8c67486d-dbe8-49e4-b9f4-aa066e128089","type":"text","text":"XXXXXX\\.","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-7"},{"id":"0e51d350-bbfc-4cde-b327-7f763283b3f7","type":"text","text":"方案二：采用以增强型80C51内核的STC系列单片机","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-8"},{"id":"84d23efc-c304-416a-9efa-0f64437786dd","type":"text","text":"XXXXXX","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-9"},{"id":"cba7095b-0538-43c0-88f9-678ff33ed4a3","type":"text","text":"通过比较，我们选择方案二。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-10"},{"id":"6f654dd5-acfe-4655-91a6-4652eccc13aa","type":"text","text":"1\\.1\\.2控制系统方案选择","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-11"},{"id":"9e8982e7-f3b2-4fc4-8b8b-e31b3596b445","type":"text","text":"方案一：采用在面包板上搭建简易单片机系统","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-12"},{"id":"87962be6-efbc-4416-bd45-ce75ab6e19d4","type":"text","text":"在面包板上搭建单片机系统可以方便的对硬件做随时修改，也易于搭建，但是系统连线较多，不仅相互干扰，使电路杂乱无章，而且系统可靠性低，不适合本系统使用。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-13"},{"id":"a0299ddf-8cc1-4365-9115-38a0f3cbe5f6","type":"text","text":"方案二：自制单片机印刷电路板","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-14"},{"id":"4a672f89-897b-4fb0-af35-c4eec5848488","type":"text","text":"自制印刷电路实现较为困难，实现周期长，此外也会花费较多的时间，影响整体设计进程。不宜采用该方案。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-15"},{"id":"059d999b-ef4e-4ae5-b41c-910acddc3367","type":"text","text":"方案三：采用单片机最小系统。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-16"},{"id":"cd8467ba-52e9-4a5f-bbb6-982b42ebaff8","type":"text","text":"单片机最小系统包含了显示、矩阵键盘、A/D、D/A等模块，能明显减少外围电路的设计，降低系统设计的难度，非常适合本系统的设计。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-17"},{"id":"6e626593-eea7-448e-beb6-d09903244daa","type":"text","text":"综合以上三种方案，选择方案三。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-18"},{"type":"title","text":"## **2、XXXX的论证与选择**","text_level":2,"page_idx":1,"id":"71744bf5-d295-4063-8427-ec76ef8b14a9","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-19"},{"id":"d5408d5b-ce76-41e6-886a-05e2dfc7b4d9","type":"text","text":"方案一：XXX。XXXX","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-20"},{"id":"c7f8b352-1535-4108-8cac-b83b0de1eaa5","type":"text","text":"方案二：XXX。XXXX","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-21"},{"id":"26b4cae1-86a7-422b-a114-9d623f53073b","type":"text","text":"方案三：XXX。XXXX","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-22"},{"id":"b534bbc3-9236-4ce3-99be-9e9a7c20db2f","type":"text","text":"综合以上三种方案，选择方案三。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-23"},{"type":"title","text":"## **3、控制系统的论证与选择**","text_level":2,"page_idx":1,"id":"b6093727