"1-64"},{"type":"title","text":"### **（4）电源**","text_level":3,"page_idx":1,"id":"e8efcb5a-5252-4738-ad10-d57183658336","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-65"},{"type":"image","img_path":"3052089f39ddd98b431ebd8cde87006c79fd8d8dd3b96124d526be487d0702d9.jpg","page_idx":1,"id":"58cca8d6-18a3-4776-80e4-728d498ef823","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"1-66"},{"type":"image","img_path":"3052089f39ddd98b431ebd8cde87006c79fd8d8dd3b96124d526be487d0702d9.jpg","page_idx":1,"id":"2495ad1b-da63-48f5-9b81-38437db419f9","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"1-67"},{"id":"9cc1d8f4-6ce1-43a4-9b8e-737e5bed3b71","type":"text","text":"电源由变压部分、滤波部分、稳压部分组成。为整个系统提供5V或者12V电压，确保电路的正常稳定工作。这部分电路比较简单，都采用三端稳压管实现，故不作详述。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-68"},{"type":"title","text":"## **2、程序的设计**","text_level":2,"page_idx":1,"id":"98a9c9ea-8e1b-49a8-97cb-cf6e521c772f","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-69"},{"type":"title","text":"### **（1）程序功能描述与设计思路**","text_level":3,"page_idx":1,"id":"4e7203b4-0156-49de-9f97-e1ed9ab0e0b6","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-70"},{"id":"76a7c295-7170-47a3-96b4-8cbb422ec352","type":"text","text":"1、程序功能描述","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-71"},{"id":"b7cd3951-bdff-460d-a554-d1431090aaa3","type":"text","text":"根据题目要求软件部分主要实现键盘的设置和显示。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-72"},{"id":"7a9bcb82-a723-4879-bd36-07798dc76583","type":"text","text":"1）键盘实现功能：设置频率值、频段、电压值以及设置输出信号类型。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-73"},{"id":"03739936-0b31-4bf5-9d88-dbe301bc4775","type":"text","text":"2）显示部分：显示电压值、频段、步进值、信号类型、频率。","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-74"},{"id":"0ecc7c5a-1642-46e8-8780-eae97e909707","type":"text","text":"2、程序设计思路","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-75"},{"type":"title","text":"### **（2）程序流程图**","text_level":3,"page_idx":1,"id":"09425b36-f1b7-415f-9e0f-5eb4dffcf722","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-76"},{"id":"fbee86a1-5bc4-4966-b33d-356059d5a8d6","type":"text","text":"1、主程序流程图","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-77"},{"id":"77e44e31-3e2e-4a9b-8723-da97f055c82c","type":"text","text":"2、XXX子程序流程图","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-78"},{"id":"593d79b8-8e9e-4355-87e9-f639895b4fc7","type":"text","text":"3、XXX子程序流程图","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-79"},{"id":"b8cc01ad-b21a-4666-bd05-cb57548e95fe","type":"text","text":"4、XXX子程序流程图","page_idx":1,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"1-80"},{"type":"title","text":"# **四、测试方案与测试结果**","text_level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"908f2ad9-81c4-47db-b3d7-0e0afff6d9b5","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222,